@startuml UML-SYNCHRONIZATION-FLOW
title Personal Knowledge Synchronization
participant "iPad Local Library" as IPad
participant "Sync Engine" as SyncA
participant "iCloud / CloudKit" as Cloud
participant "Sync Engine" as SyncB
participant "Mac Local Library" as Mac
IPad -> IPad: Commit annotation locally
IPad -> SyncA: Queue Personal Knowledge version
SyncA -> Cloud: Push encrypted/versioned change
Cloud -> SyncB: Pull change
SyncB -> Mac: Apply or detect conflict
alt conflict
 Mac -> SyncB: Preserve competing versions
 SyncB -> Mac: Create merge task
else no conflict
 Mac -> Mac: Commit synchronized version
end
note over Cloud: Publication payloads and Master Catalog are excluded
@enduml
